/**
 * Runtime support for vecDSL programs generated for Qdrant with {{sdk.java.group}}:{{sdk.java.artifact}} {{sdk.java.version}}
 * over gRPC. The generated programs pass collection layouts, records and filters in the JSON vocabulary of the
 * Qdrant REST API, which this runtime converts to the SDK's gRPC messages. Generated by vecDSL 7. Do not edit.
 */
